# Third-Party AI/ML Tools — Combined Register

## Overview
This register documents third-party AI/ML tools and frameworks that are forks or locally modified installations. These are primarily inference servers, web UIs, and content generation tools for various AI tasks.

---

## ComfyUI
**PATH**: `~/Projects/ComfyUI`  
**DESCRIPTION**: Node-based workflow UI for Stable Diffusion and AI image generation  
**UPSTREAM**: https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI.git  
**FORK STATUS**: Direct clone (not a fork)  
**LAST MODIFIED**: 2026-02-02  
**LOCAL MODIFICATIONS**: Yes (35 files modified)  

**PURPOSE**: Advanced image generation with node-based workflow system. Supports custom models, ControlNet, and complex generation pipelines.

**MODIFICATIONS**:
- Database integration (alembic_db/ directory present)
- Custom nodes and workflow configurations
- Local model storage and management

